1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Find the wonder, find the joy, find the magic

2
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Us Again is a animation, drama, family film directed by Zach Parrish.

3
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
In a vibrant city pulsating with rhythm and movement, an elderly man and his young-at-heart wife
rekindle their youthful passion for life and each other on one magical night.

4
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Us Again is a 2021 American animated short film directed and written by Zach
Parrish and distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures.

5
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
It follows Art, a grumpy old man, and Dot, his
energetic wife, in a vibrant city of dance.

6
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:06,000
The two enjoy themselves in a rainstorm that makes them young
until it disappears and reverts them back to old age.

7
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Parrish conceived Us Again after noticing that he was growing
older and took inspiration from his grandparents.

8
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Its score, composed by Pinar Toprak, was written before storyboarding
and animation, unlike the typical filmmaking process.

9
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:36,000
For dance reference, Disney hired choreographers Keone and Mari Madrid.

10
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Us Again was released on March 5, 2021, preceding
theatrical showings of Raya and the Last Dragon.

11
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
The short has received positive reviews from critics.

12
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
The film explores themes of new york city, dancing, rain, musical, lovers.

13
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:36,000
The tone is emotional.
